3. Source feasibility: what can actually supply opportunities?

This is the most important section. A provider is not “integrated” until we have confirmed: official access, allowed use, the relevant record type, fields, pagination, quotas, freshness, attribution, application URL, authentication and a passing live contract test.

3.1 Source tiers

Tier 1 — Public documented feeds: build first, but only for Remote Roles

